## 1. DESIGN IDENTITY

**What PRESCOPE is:** a precision lifestyle intelligence tool for women who
want to understand and actively manage their health risk. Not a hospital. Not
a wellness blog. Not a generic health app.

**Visual personality:** confident, calm and precise — like a world-class
private clinic that also feels human. Headspace's calm meets Mayo Clinic's
credibility meets Apple Health's clarity. The visual language says: "we take
this seriously, and so do you."

**Role to inhabit when building:** a senior wellness-app designer who has
shipped top-rated health apps (Calm, Flo, Headspace, Clue). Every screen must
look hand-crafted by a design studio — never template-driven.

