## 4. SPACING & LAYOUT

### Scale (multiples of 4)
| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `micro` | 4 | Inline icon gaps, chip padding |
| `sm` | 8 | Between related elements (label → input) |
| `mdSm` | 12 | Card internal padding minimum |
| `base` | 16 | Standard card padding, list item gaps |
| `screenX` | 20 | **Screen horizontal padding** |
| `md` | 24 | Between major sections |
| `lg` | 32 | Screen top/bottom padding |
| `xxl` | 48 | Hero breathing room |

### Layout rules
1. **Screen padding is 20px** (`spacing.screenX`). `components/ui/Screen.tsx`
   applies this centrally — do not re-pad a screen root. `px-4` *inside a
   card* is correct and is not a violation.
2. **Card padding** `p-4` (16) minimum; `p-5` (20) for content-heavy cards.
3. **Radii** — cards and surfaces `rounded-2xl` / `radius.card` (16); buttons
   and inputs `rounded-xl` / `radius.button` (12); chips, tags and avatars
   `rounded-full` / `radius.chip`; bottom sheets `radius.sheet` (24).
   Inputs keep 12 even though they sit on a card — that is intentional.
4. **Shadows are blue-tinted, never black.** Use `shadows.card` /
   `shadows.button` from `lib/design-tokens.ts`.
5. **Vertical rhythm between cards** `gap-4` minimum, `gap-5` ideal.
6. **Section headers** left-aligned, `mb-3` below, `mt-6` above.
7. **Safe area** — always via `Screen`, which wraps `SafeAreaView`.
8. **ScrollView** — always `showsVerticalScrollIndicator={false}`, and reserve
   bottom clearance for the tab bar (`Screen` reserves 96px; the bar is ~52px
   plus the bottom inset).
9. **Never centre body text.** Left-align. Centre only hero headlines and
   empty states.
10. **Max content width** `max-w-[420px]` self-centred on large screens.

