## 5. COMPONENT PATTERNS

Reuse what is in `components/ui/` before building anything new.

### Cards
```
bg-white · border border-border (or none + shadows.card) · rounded-2xl
p-5 · gap-3 between elements
Icon: 40-48px in a 10% primaryBlue tinted circle, top-left
Title: Plus Jakarta 700, deepNavy
Description: Plus Jakarta 400, slate, max 2 lines
CTA: right-aligned chevron, or a bottom-right primaryBlue text link
Emphasis: fill iceBlue — never a full-strength primaryBlue ring
```

### Buttons (`components/ui/Button.tsx`)
```
Primary     bg-primaryBlue, white label, rounded-xl, shadows.button
            pressed → primaryBluePressed (deepNavy)
Secondary   glass/iceBlue surface, primaryBlue label, rounded-xl
Text/Ghost  transparent, primaryBlue label at 600 (never skyBlue — 2.44:1)
Destructive bg-riskHigh, white label. Sparingly, always with confirmation.
Disabled    opacity 0.5, no shadow, no handler

Minimum height 48px (tapTarget). Label Plus Jakarta 600, 15-16px,
sentence case. Icon + text: 8px gap, 20px icon. Never more than two
buttons side by side. Bottom-fixed CTAs sit on a blurred chrome surface
with a hairline top border.
```
A spinner inside a submitting button is correct — see section 9.

### Inputs
```
Default  bg-white, border border-border, rounded-xl, px-4 py-3.5, 16px text
         placeholder → mist
Focus    border-primaryBlue, 2px
Error    border-riskHigh + riskHighText caption below
Label    deepNavy, 600, 14px, mb-1.5 — above the field, never placeholder-only
Helper   slate, 13px, mt-1
Error    riskHighText, 13px, mt-1
Multi-line  min-h-[120px], textAlignVertical="top"

Never underline-only (Material style). Group related inputs with a 12px gap.
Always set autoCapitalize, autoCorrect and keyboardType deliberately.
A neutral input border is `border`, never a status colour — green on a
default field reads as a success state.
```

### Status chips
```
Low       bg-riskLowLight      + deepNavy label + riskLow dot
Moderate  bg-riskModerateLight + deepNavy label + riskModerate dot
High      bg-riskHighLight     + deepNavy label + riskHigh dot
Info      bg-iceBlue           + primaryBlue label

rounded-full, px-3 py-1, chip type token, min-w-[72px], centred text.

The label is deepNavy (13-15:1 on these tints), not the status colour —
see section 2. The colour cue comes from the fill and the icon. Pair icon
with text for important statuses.
```

### Bottom sheets / modals
```
Overlay  bg-black/40 (not /60 — keep it light)
Sheet    bg-white, radius.sheet top corners, pt-2
Handle   w-10 h-1 bg-mist/40 rounded-full, self-centred, mb-4
Padding  px-5 pt-4 pb-8
Animate with reanimated (spring slide-up). Always give a close
affordance — an X top-right or drag-down.
```

### Lists
```
FlatList or SectionList for anything data-driven or variable-length.
A fixed, short, static menu may use a ScrollView — say so in a comment,
because the audit checks for it.
Separator 1px border-border/30, inset by the screen padding
Item padding py-4 px-5 · right chevron 20px mist
Swipe actions use expo-haptics. Empty state = illustration + heading +
description + CTA.
```

### Loading
`components/ui/Skeleton.tsx` — `Skeleton`, `SkeletonText`, `SkeletonCard`,
`SkeletonCardList`. 1500ms shimmer sweep, drops to a static fill under
reduced motion. `StaticSkeleton` is a thin alias kept for older imports.

