## 6. ICONOGRAPHY

- **One icon set per screen.** Ionicons or Feather — this codebase uses
  **Feather** throughout, so match it.
- MaterialCommunityIcons only for genuinely health-specific glyphs.
- Sizes: 20px inline, 24px navigation, 32–48px feature.
- Colour: `primaryBlue` interactive, `mist` decorative, `deepNavy`
  informational. Vivid risk colours are fine on icons (3:1 suffices).
- Feature icons sit in a 40–48px circle at 10% tint:
```tsx
<View className="h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primaryBlue/10">
  <Feather name="heart" size={24} color={colors.primaryBlue} />
</View>
```
- No stethoscopes, blue crosses or clipart medicine.

