## 8. MOTION

Motion should feel organic and calm — this is a wellness app, not a fintech
dashboard. Use `react-native-reanimated`; never `Animated` from RN core.
Default easing `Easing.bezier(0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1.0)`; 250–350ms for UI,
400–600ms for page transitions.

| Interaction | Animation | Duration |
|---|---|---|
| Screen enter | Fade in + slide up 16px | 350ms |
| Card press | Scale 0.97, spring back | 150ms |
| Button press | Scale 0.95 | 100ms |
| Tab switch | Crossfade | 200ms |
| Bottom sheet | Spring slide up | 400ms, damping 20 |
| Score reveal | Counter roll-up (DM Mono) | 800ms |
| Progress fill | Width spring | 600ms |
| Success check | Scale from 0 + rotate | 400ms spring |
| Error shake | translateX oscillation | 300ms |
| Skeleton | Shimmer sweep | 1500ms loop |

**Always honour `useReducedMotion()`** — `PressScale` and `Skeleton` already do.

**Do not:** stagger every list item on scroll, add scroll parallax,
auto-play carousels, or bounce notification badges.

