## 10. ACCESSIBILITY

Not optional. Build it in from the start.

```
Minimum tap target  48×48px (tapTarget) on everything interactive
Colour contrast     4.5:1 for body text (WCAG AA)
                    3:1 for large text (18px+, or 14px+ bold) and for
                    icons, borders and other non-text UI
Focus indicators    visible ring for keyboard/switch navigation
Screen reader       accessibilityLabel on every interactive element
                    accessibilityHint where not self-explanatory
                    accessibilityRole where relevant
Dynamic text        layouts must survive 1.5× text scale
Reduced motion      check useReducedMotion, cut transitions when true
```

