## 12. COPYWRITING (voice & tone)

Match the design: confident, warm, precise. Not chatty. Not clinical.

- **Sentence case everywhere.** Not Title Case, never ALL CAPS for body.
- **Active voice:** "We check your stress hormone", not "Stress hormones are
  checked".
- **Specific over vague:** "This takes about 8 minutes", not "a few minutes".
- **Never use:** "Please", "Sorry", "Unfortunately", "As an AI", "Note that".
- **Results:** lead with what it means for the user, not the raw number.
- **Errors:** what happened and what to do. "Your session expired. Log in
  again."
- **Safety alerts:** calm and directive. "Let's get you the right care."
- **Button labels:** verb + object. "Save answers", not "Submit". "See my
  plan", not "Next".
- **Completion:** acknowledge effort. "Section 3 done — you're making real
  progress."
- **Empty states:** future-positive. "Your results will appear here."
- **No user-facing string inline in JSX.** Everything goes through
  `lib/copy.ts`.
- Never claim the app diagnoses, detects or treats anything. It is a
  lifestyle awareness tool.

