## 14. IMAGES & ILLUSTRATION

- **Always `expo-image`**, never `Image` from react-native. Set
  `contentFit="cover"` and `transition={300}`, and give a `placeholder`
  blurhash where you have one.
- **Text over a photo** needs `gradients.imageScrim` beneath it.
- Rounded images `rounded-2xl`; avatars `rounded-full`.
- Aspect ratios: hero 16:9 or 3:2, thumbnails 1:1, profile 1:1.
- Photography: calm, diverse women in real wellness contexts.
- Illustration: clean line art or soft flat, brand palette only, SVG via
  `react-native-svg`, under ~50KB. Use for empty states, onboarding and
  feature explanations.

---

## 15. ANTI-PATTERNS — NEVER DO THESE

1. No gray backgrounds. `iceBlue` or `white`.
2. No pure black text or black shadows. `deepNavy`, blue-tinted shadows.
3. No system fonts. Use the loaded faces via `lib/typography.ts`.
4. No equal-weight everything — build hierarchy with size, weight and colour.
5. No cramped layouts. 16px inside cards, 20px at screen edges.
6. No orphaned screens. Every screen has a back path and knows its context.
7. No raw error messages. Styled alert, icon, friendly copy, an action.
8. No unstyled loading. Shimmer skeletons, with the three spinner exceptions
   in section 9.
9. No walls of text. Scannable cards, icons, paragraphs under three lines.
10. No inconsistent radii. See section 4.3.
11. No floating element without a subtle blue-tinted shadow.
12. No mixing icon sets on one screen.
13. No hardcoded user-facing strings. Use `lib/copy.ts`.
14. No `console.log` in a component.
15. No inline styles where a token or NativeWind class exists — and **no
    hardcoded hex anywhere outside the three token files.**
16. No status colour as text. Use the `*Text` variants.
17. No status colour as a neutral border. Green on a default input reads as
    success.

